<title>FRANCE: GdesEaux sees big debt reduction in 1997.</title>
<headline>GdesEaux sees big debt reduction in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Generale des Eaux said in a statement it expected a &quot;significant&quot; reduction in its debt of about 10 to 15 billion francs in 1997.</p>
<p>It said it expected its net financial debt to stand at 53 billion francs at the end of 1996, from 54 billion in 1995.</p>
</text>
